    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "On le trouve partout à Galar. S’il n’a pas de Baies en réserve dans ses deux joues, il devient anxieux.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Found throughout the Galar region, this Pokémon becomes uneasy if its cheeks are ever completely empty of berries.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ガラルの　いたるところに　いる。 左右の　ほっぺに　木の実を 蓄えていないと　不安。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Comme il mange tout le temps des Baies, il est plus costaud qu’il n’en a l’air. Il parcourt les champs à la recherche de sa précieuse denrée.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It eats berries nonstop—a habit that has made it more resilient than it looks. It’ll show up on farms, searching for yet more berries.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "つねに　木の実を　食っているので 見かけ以上に　タフ。　木の実を 狙って　畑に　現れる。",
        "language": {
